          </mods:name>
          <mods:abstract>
            The classic Iris dataset contains 150 samples of iris flowers, including
            sepal length, sepal width, petal length, petal width, and species.
            It is converted from UCI ML Repository format to a single HDF5 file.
          </mods:abstract>
          <mods:originInfo>
